# `$isPrototypeChainPlain(Class)`: THE WORD OF $isPlainInstanceOf ON WHAT SEES A READ OR A STORE ABOVE, ASKED WITHOUT AN OBJECT: no accessor and no property that is not writable has been defined on the prototype object
# of the class or of a class above it, no link of that chain has changed, and `Class.prototype` is the object that it was. It is for a birth: behind `new.target === Class` the object is fresh.
